#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldAndInit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Scaffold a starter project for a platform (via `@pantoken/scaffold`), and install pantoken's\nagent assets (via [installAgentAssets](installAgentAssets.md)) into the same directory."
msgstr "Luodaan aloitusprojekti alustalle (käyttäen `@pantoken/scaffold`), ja asennetaan pantokenin\nagenttiresurssit (käyttäen [installAgentAssets](installAgentAssets.md)) samaan hakemistoon."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldAndInit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A [ScaffoldPlatform](../type-aliases/ScaffoldPlatform.md)."
msgstr "ScaffoldPlatform-tyyppi: [ScaffoldPlatform](../type-aliases/ScaffoldPlatform.md)."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldAndInit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The target directory (default `\".\"`). Its basename (or `\"pantoken-app\"` for `\".\"`)\n  is substituted for `{{projectName}}` in the scaffold's template files."
msgstr "Kohdehakemisto (oletus `\".\"`). Sen perusnimi (tai `\"pantoken-app\"` `\".\"`-tapauksessa)\n  korvataan `{{projectName}}`:lla scaffoldin mallipohjatiedostoissa."

