#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: scaffoldProject()"
msgstr "# Funktio: scaffoldProject()"

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldProject.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Scaffold a starter project for a platform, with pantoken already installed and wired in."
msgstr "Luo alustalle aloitusprojekti, jossa pantoken on jo asennettu ja integroitu."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldProject.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The target directory (default `\".\"`). Its basename (or `\"pantoken-app\"` for `\".\"`)\n  is substituted for `{{projectName}}` in the template files."
msgstr "Kohdekansio (oletus `\".\"`). Sen perusnimi (tai `\"pantoken-app\"` kohdalla `\".\"`)\n  korvataan mallipohjatiedostoissa `{{projectName}}`."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldProject.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### options?"
msgstr "### options?"

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldProject.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`theme`/`mode` select which `@pantoken/css` token sheet scaffolded files\n  import (default `\"rebrand\"`/`\"light\"`), applied across every platform. `cdn` selects the CDN\n  provider `canvas-theme-editor`'s `theme.css`/`theme.js` are built for (default jsDelivr);\n  ignored by every other platform."
msgstr "`theme`/`mode` valitsevat, mitkä `@pantoken/css`-tokenitaulukon skeletontiedostot\n  tuodaan (oletus `\"rebrand\"`/`\"light\"`), ja niitä sovelletaan kaikilla alustoilla. `cdn` valitsee CDN-palveluntarjoajan; `canvas-theme-editor`:n `theme.css`/`theme.js` rakennetaan tälle palveluntarjoajalle (oletus jsDelivr);\n  muut alustat jättävät ne huomiotta."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldProject.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "#### theme?"
msgstr "#### theme?"

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldProject.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "#### mode?"
msgstr "#### mode?"

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldProject.md
#, no-c-format
