#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Interface: CommandEventish"
msgstr "# Rajapinta: CommandEventish"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `command`/`source` shape of an Invoker Commands `CommandEvent` (not yet in DOM lib types)."
msgstr "`command`/`source`-muotoinen Invoker Commands -komennon `CommandEvent` (ei vielä DOM-kirjastotyyppinä)."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### command"
msgstr "### command"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### source"
msgstr "### source"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### bubbles"
msgstr "### bubbles"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`bubbles`** read-only property of the Event interface indicates whether the event bubbles up through the DOM tree or not."
msgstr "**`bubbles`**-vainlukuinen ominaisuus Event-rajapinnassa ilmaisee, kuplivatko tapahtumat DOM-puun läpi vai eivät."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### ~~cancelBubble~~"
msgstr "### ~~cancelBubble~~"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`cancelBubble`** property of the Event interface is deprecated. Use Event.stopPropagation() instead. Setting its value to true before returning from an event handler prevents propagation of the event. In later implementations, setting this to false does nothing. See Browser compatibility for details."
msgstr "Event-rajapinnan **`cancelBubble`**-ominaisuus on vanhentunut. Käytä sen sijaan Event.stopPropagation()-metodia. Asettamalla sen arvoksi true ennen tapahtumankäsittelijästä paluuta estetään tapahtuman propagaatio. Myöhemmissä toteutuksissa arvon asettaminen falseksi ei tee mitään. Katso selainten yhteensopivuus lisätiedoista."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "#### Deprecated"
msgstr "#### Vanhentunut"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### cancelable"
msgstr "### cancelable"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`cancelable`** read-only property of the Event interface indicates whether the event can be canceled, and therefore prevented as if the event never happened."
msgstr "Event-rajapinnan **`cancelable`**-vainlukuinen ominaisuus ilmaisee, voidaanko tapahtuma peruuttaa (ja siten estää ikään kuin tapahtumaa ei olisi koskaan tapahtunut)."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### composed"
msgstr "### composed"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The read-only **`composed`** property of the Event interface returns a boolean value which indicates whether or not the event will propagate across the shadow DOM boundary into the standard DOM."
msgstr "Event-rajapinnan vainlukuinen **`composed`**-ominaisuus palauttaa boolean-arvon, joka ilmaisee, kulkeeko tapahtuma shadow DOM -rajan yli tavalliseen DOM:iin vai ei."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### currentTarget"
msgstr "### currentTarget"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`currentTarget`** read-only property of the Event interface identifies the element to which the event handler has been attached."
msgstr "Event-rajapinnan **`currentTarget`**-vainlukuinen ominaisuus tunnistaa elementin, johon tapahtumankäsittelijä on liitetty."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### defaultPrevented"
msgstr "### defaultPrevented"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`defaultPrevented`** read-only property of the Event interface returns a boolean value indicating whether or not the call to Event.preventDefault() canceled the event."
msgstr "Event-rajapinnan **`defaultPrevented`**-vainlukuinen ominaisuus palauttaa boolean-arvon, joka ilmaisee, peruutettiinko Event.preventDefault()-kutsulla tapahtuma."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### eventPhase"
msgstr "### eventPhase"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`eventPhase`** read-only property of the Event interface indicates which phase of the event flow is currently being evaluated."
msgstr "Event-rajapinnan **`eventPhase`**-vainlukuinen ominaisuus ilmoittaa, mitä vaihetta tapahtumavirran arvioinnissa parhaillaan käsitellään."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### isTrusted"
msgstr "### isTrusted"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`isTrusted`** read-only property of the Event interface is a boolean value that is true when the event was generated by the user agent (including via user actions and programmatic methods such as HTMLElement.focus()), and false when the event was dispatched via EventTarget.dispatchEvent(). The only exception is the click event, which initializes the isTrusted property to false in user agents."
msgstr "Event-rajapinnan **`isTrusted`**-vainlukuinen ominaisuus on boolean-arvo, joka on true, kun tapahtuman on luonut käyttäjäagentti (mukaan lukien käyttäjän toiminnot ja ohjelmalliset menetelmät kuten HTMLElement.focus()), ja false, kun tapahtuma on lähetetty EventTarget.dispatchEvent():lla. Poikkeuksena on click-tapahtuma, jonka isTrusted-ominaisuus alustetaan käyttäjäagenteissa arvolla false."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### ~~returnValue~~"
msgstr "### ~~returnValue~~"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The Event property **`returnValue`** indicates whether the default action for this event has been prevented or not."
msgstr "Event-ominaisuus **`returnValue`** kertoo, onko tämän tapahtuman oletustoiminto estetty vai ei."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### ~~srcElement~~"
msgstr "### ~~srcElement~~"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The deprecated **`Event.srcElement`** is an alias for the Event.target property. Use Event.target instead."
msgstr "Vanhentunut **`Event.srcElement`** on alias Event.target-ominaisuudelle. Käytä Event.targetia sen sijaan."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The read-only **`target`** property of the Event interface is a reference to the object onto which the event was dispatched. It is different from Event.currentTarget when the event handler is called during the bubbling or capturing phase of the event."
msgstr "Event-rajapinnan vainlukuinen **`target`**-ominaisuus on viite objektiin, jolle tapahtuma on lähetetty. Se eroaa Event.currentTargetista, kun tapahtumankäsittelijä kutsutaan tapahtuman kuplimis- tai kaappaamisvaiheessa."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### timeStamp"
msgstr "### timeStamp"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`timeStamp`** read-only property of the Event interface returns the time (in milliseconds) at which the event was created."
msgstr "Event-rajapinnan **`timeStamp`**-vainlukuinen ominaisuus palauttaa ajan (millisekunteina), jolloin tapahtuma luotiin."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`type`** read-only property of the Event interface returns a string containing the event's type. It is set when the event is constructed and is the name commonly used to refer to the specific event, such as click, load, or error."
msgstr "Event-rajapinnan **`type`**-vainlukuinen ominaisuus palauttaa merkkijonon, joka sisältää tapahtuman tyypin. Se asetetaan tapahtuman luomishetkellä ja on yleisesti käytetty nimi tietylle tapahtumalle, kuten click, load tai error."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### NONE"
msgstr "### NONE"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### CAPTURING\\_PHASE"
msgstr "### CAPTURING\\_PHASE"

