#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### AT\\_TARGET"
msgstr "### AT\\_TARGET"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### BUBBLING\\_PHASE"
msgstr "### BUBBLING\\_PHASE"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### composedPath()"
msgstr "### composedPath()"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`composedPath()`** method of the Event interface returns the event's path which is an array of the objects on which listeners will be invoked. This does not include nodes in shadow trees if the shadow root was created with its ShadowRoot.mode closed."
msgstr "Event-rajapinnan **`composedPath()`**-metodi palauttaa tapahtuman polun, joka on taulukko objekteista, joilla kuuntelijat tullaan kutsumaan. Tämä ei sisällä solmuja shadow-puissa, jos shadow root on luotu ShadowRoot.mode:lla closed."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### ~~initEvent()~~"
msgstr "### ~~initEvent()~~"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`Event.initEvent()`** method is used to initialize the value of an event created using Document.createEvent()."
msgstr "Metodia **`Event.initEvent()`** käytetään alustamaan tapahtuman arvo, kun tapahtuma luodaan Document.createEvent():lla."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "##### type"
msgstr "##### type"

