msgstr "Shadow-DOM:n julkistetut parts (`::part(name)`), `@csspart`-tai `::part()`-valitsimesta."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
